  (text "04 ESP32-S3-WROOM-1-N16R8, buttons, TCA9535 slow control, I2C pull-ups, expansion" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 7.62 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "54bfad1b-6c54-5bce-ac47-bee0e64d9517"))
  (text "GPIO allocation = docs/INTERFACE_GPIO_MAP.md. GPIO3/45/46 straps and GPIO35-37 (octal PSRAM) are no-connect." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 13.97 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "da2bf9b1-a2d5-5b3b-9e65-0d305c965c52"))
  (text "TCA9535 map = docs/CONTROL_IO_REVIEW.md DIG-03 plus ONE-SHOT PROPOSALS for the spare ports: P07 EXP_CS_N (expansion CS has no ESP32 GPIO in the map)," (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 16.51 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "83997e9b-5aac-56bf-a3c9-9f11f8837986"))
  (text "P10 SX_NRESET (was reserved SX aux), P14 RP_RUN (DIG-01 host reset), P15 BUCK_PG (input), P17 CHG_EN (charger enable, hardware default = disabled)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 19.05 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "eed3ac58-5189-5623-983f-536e83d982cf"))
  (text "I2C 100 kHz, 2.2k pull-ups on 3V3_MAIN (D22). JST GH BM12B-GHS-TBT is a VERTICAL (top-entry) header in JST/KiCad naming, not right-angle as the BOM text says." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 21.59 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "acc953ea-f2ac-5285-a866-1522e2e25edc"))
  (embedded_fonts no)
